# P114 on iOS (UIKitBackend): the platform's own Back pops the NavigationStack -- a swipe in from the left edge of the screen, as UINavigationController pops, and Command-[ from a hardware keyboard.
# Pushes go through the drawn controls (taplabel). Pops: edge swipe, Command-[, edge swipe; then one edge swipe at the root, which must change nothing.
# The swipes start one point from the screen's left edge (origin screen, so no anchor moves them) and are thrown right at 800 points a second.
# Pass: the replay reports replayed; the log shows depths 1 2 3 2 1 0 1 in that order (no second 0); the final capture shows the Fruits screen under a "‹ Home" back control.
# P114 在 iOS(UIKitBackend)上：平台自己的返回彈出 NavigationStack——從螢幕左緣向內滑動(與 UINavigationController 相同),以及實體鍵盤的 Command-[。推入用畫出的控制項(taplabel);彈出依序為邊緣滑動、Command-[、邊緣滑動，接著在根層再滑一次，必須什麼都不改變。通過條件見上方英文說明。
